sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/darwin1859-ch09-03> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch09-03--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch09-03--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on darwin1859-ch09-03: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.93" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.1.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.927"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "resolvable-now" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.88"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "The claim is a specific duration for a named English denudation and for time since the late Chalk. The international time scale and British geological mapping contain those ages at the needed resolution, and comparing them with 300 million years is immediate. Radiometric ages do not depend on the denudation-rate assumption, so the elapsed-time conclusion can be confirmed or refuted cleanly." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Compare Darwin's figure of about 300 million years since the latter part of the Secondary period with the radiometric age of the Chalk and of Weald denudation. An elapsed time of that order would support the inference; an age several times shorter would refute it. Measured coastal-retreat rates can separately check the one-inch-per-century premise." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "Modern cliff retreat varies by lithology and setting, so the erosion-rate premise is noisier than the age of the Chalk.", "Which bed counts as the latter part of the Secondary period shifts the target age by tens of millions of years, not by the factor at issue." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/darwin1859-ch09-03--grok--dataset-1>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/darwin1859-ch09-03--grok--dataset-2> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch09-03--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of darwin1859-ch09-03 by Grok 4.7: 0.95" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.1.0-operationalizability> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0/operationalizability" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.95"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch09-03--grok> ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/darwin1859-ch09-03> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch09-03--grok--operationalizability> .
